<title>USA: Genesis sets 5 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Genesis sets 5 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genesis International Financial Services Inc Friday said its board approved a five percent stock dividend for all bonafide shareholders effective January 21, 1997.</p>
</text>
